= Biograph

== About Me

I obtained the Ph.D. degree (advised by [http://www.math.uestc.edu.cn/info/1081/2041.htm Prof. Ting-Zhu Huang] and [https://zhaoxile.github.io/ Prof. Xi-Le Zhao]) with the [http://www.math.uestc.edu.cn/index.htm School of Mathematical Sciences], [https://www.uestc.edu.cn/ University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC)], Chengdu, China. 

== Education and Work Experience

- 2021.01-now: Assistant Professor, School of Mathematics, Southwest Jiaotong University (SWJTU)

- 2018.09-2022.12: [https://www.uestc.edu.cn/ University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC)]; Ph. D. student in Applied Mathematics (Supervisor: [http://www.math.uestc.edu.cn/info/1081/2041.htm Prof. Ting-Zhu Huang])

- 2019.09-2020.09: [https://oregonstate.edu/ Oregon State University]; Exchange visitor in Signal Processing (Supervisor: [https://web.engr.oregonstate.edu/~fuxia/ Prof. Xiao Fu] and [http://www.math.uestc.edu.cn/info/1081/2041.htm Prof. Ting-Zhu Huang])

- 2016.09-2018.06: [https://www.uestc.edu.cn/ University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC)]; Bachelor student in Information and Computing Science

- 2012.09-2016.6: [https://www.uestc.edu.cn/ University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC)]; Bachelor student in Information and Computing Science

== Awards and Honors

- Outstanding student of USETC (highest personal honor for graduate students in UESTC), 2021

- National Scholarship (highest national wide scholarship for students in China), 2021

- First-class academic scholarship, UESTC, 2019

- Special postgraduate scholarship of science, UESTC, 2018